  "back_side": {
    "red_zone": [],
    "goal_line": [],
    "backed_up": [],
    "two_minute": [],
    "blitz_beaters": [],
    "gadgets": [],
    "two_point": [],
    "four_minute": []
  }
}

Each play entry should have:
{
  "play_name": "Name",
  "formation": "Formation",
  "play_type": "Type",
  "personnel": "11",
  "full_call": "Full headset call",
  "wristband_number": 1,
  "confidence": 5,
  "notes": "Any quick reminder"
}

RULES:
- Assign sequential wristband numbers starting at 1
- Top plays (confidence 5) should be listed first in each section
- Maximum 8 plays per section on the front side, 6 per section on the back side
- The call sheet must be scannable — a coordinator has 25 seconds between plays`;

